#: desklet.js:83
msgid ""
"The next 24 hours per place: strong = working hours (9-17), light = awake (7-22), dark = night.\n"
"Line on top: hours when it is daytime everywhere.\n"
"Mouse wheel: shift the time in 30-minute steps."
msgstr ""
"Die nächsten 24 Stunden je Ort: kräftig = Arbeitszeit (9–17 Uhr), hell = wach (7–22 Uhr), dunkel = Nacht.\n"
"Strich oben: Stunden, in denen überall Tag ist.\n"
"Mausrad: Zeit in Schritten von 30 Minuten verschieben."

